# --- Automation Module: added -- there was no .dockerignore here -------------
# Without one, `COPY . /app` copied the entire directory into the image. That
# layer measured 229 MB and included things that should never ship:
#
#   .env        the JWT SECRET_KEY, readable from the image with `docker cp`
#   admin.db    17 real user rows, and local auth stores passwords in plaintext
#   .venv312    214 MB of Windows virtualenv, inert inside a Linux container
#
# Neither .env nor admin.db is needed at runtime: docker-compose supplies the
# environment with env_file from the host, and DATABASE_URL points at the
# volume-mounted database under /app/external-db.

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.env
.env_bkp
*.env_bkp
!.env.example
# Written by the Settings screen; environment.json holds the Solutions API token.
app/config.json
app/environment.json
.build-proxy

# ── Data ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── Environments and caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv
.venv*/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ── Build and runtime output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
storage/
automation_workspace/
playwright-report/
test-results/
*.log
logs/
data/

# ── Repository and editor metadata ───────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Documentation and one-off scripts ────────────────────────────────────────
# Kept out of the image because they are read by people, not run by the app.
*.md
diagrams/
docker-compose*.yml
